==Trivia==
This card is one of several featured in the {{TCGP|Space-Time Smackdown}} expansion's "Manaphy Travelogue" [[Space-Time Smackdown (TCG Pocket)#Themed Collections|Themed Collection]], all of which feature {{p|Manaphy}} in their standard prints' artwork. Two {{p|Shellos}} (one West Sea and one East Sea) are also featured in the illustration rare print of {{TCG ID|Space-Time Smackdown|Manaphy|162}} from the same expansion.

===Origin===
*This card features {{p|Shellos}} in both its {{form|Shellos|West Sea and East Sea}} forms.
*{{m|Mud-Slap}} is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Shellos}} can learn.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Scarlet}}.

